  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a startup performance issue in the TPAP transport where the first secure handshake per process could take several minutes on slower/embedded CPU hosts. The internal SecureRandom instance previously relied on BouncyCastle's default timing-based entropy seeding, which is CPU-speed dependent; it now seeds from the platform's cryptographically secure RNG (CryptoApiRandomGenerator) instead, eliminating the delay with no change to cryptographic security. This is an internal-only change with no public API impact. Added unit tests verifying fast, non-degenerate SecureRandom seeding.",
